{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GrimRail is a first-person psychological horror puzzle game about survival, choice, and uncovering hidden truths.</strong> Explore impossible spaces, confront unsettling passengers, and endure the terrors that stalk each cursed stop on this primordial train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/a0864fed5581c5126679f18ccc1f1503.avif?t=1768549265\" width=1560 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fellow travelers are trapped in the same timeless loop, each burdened with secrets. Piece together their stories across repeated cycles. Confront Clair, Malik, and Rosa with what you uncover, test fragile bonds, and decide whether to offer judgment or redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/c588f3951cf7b76d4c2a54c569218be3.poster.avif?t=1768549265\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/c588f3951cf7b76d4c2a54c569218be3.webm?t=1768549265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/c588f3951cf7b76d4c2a54c569218be3.mp4?t=1768549265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/3fcb3383931f020eb7fbe305174a2a05.poster.avif?t=1768549265\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/3fcb3383931f020eb7fbe305174a2a05.webm?t=1768549265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/3fcb3383931f020eb7fbe305174a2a05.mp4?t=1768549265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/6af3b0bcee79da1019725ec72d1cce33.poster.avif?t=1768549265\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/6af3b0bcee79da1019725ec72d1cce33.webm?t=1768549265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/6af3b0bcee79da1019725ec72d1cce33.mp4?t=1768549265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/b164c60515894c3cb2e5e01c55c081db.avif?t=1768549265\" width=1107 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stop is a trial filled with shifting nightmares where abominations roam. Hide from their gaze, use stealth and cunning to endure, and push deeper into their domains. Death resets the cycle but never breaks it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/87e7668d6ceb7853b069ccf1ce3c59e0.poster.avif?t=1768549265\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/87e7668d6ceb7853b069ccf1ce3c59e0.webm?t=1768549265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/87e7668d6ceb7853b069ccf1ce3c59e0.mp4?t=1768549265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/29f142a32936d61236657ff6a143fccd.avif?t=1768549265\" width=1507 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious radio grafted into your arm binds you to the train. It whispers memories, calls to strange recordings, and seems to alter the world around you. Its purpose is unclear, but it is both a burden and a key to uncovering the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/9565eb05f9bbd72c9af865775d854b0e.poster.avif?t=1768549265\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/9565eb05f9bbd72c9af865775d854b0e.webm?t=1768549265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/9565eb05f9bbd72c9af865775d854b0e.mp4?t=1768549265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/0c3c11988989d5f09a5c1f21ad00c70f.avif?t=1768549265\" width=1560 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GrimRail\u2019s stops are surreal spaces that knot, flip, and bend around you. Solve puzzles, unlock paths, and resist the horrors that guard the truth. The train never stops, and death provides no release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/a95a54f4d37310f7a5d774460d8b6160.poster.avif?t=1768549265\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/a95a54f4d37310f7a5d774460d8b6160.webm?t=1768549265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/a95a54f4d37310f7a5d774460d8b6160.mp4?t=1768549265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Rich and Choice Driven Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Passenger fates shift with your decisions and dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 A blend of atmosphere, dread, and distorted realities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Corridors and rooms twist into solvable, mind bending spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth Survival</strong> \u2013 Hide and endure abominations that stalk each stop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 Cycles conclude in different ways shaped by your actions</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You'll Love GrimRail If:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re drawn to unsettling atmospheric story-telling, narrative weight, and survival through wit and will. Fans of GrimRail love:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouthwashing</strong> \u2013 surreal psychological storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOMA</strong> \u2013 existential horror and shifting realities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amnesia: The Dark Descent</strong> \u2013 stealth, dread, and endurance against the unseen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pathologic</strong> \u2013 moral choices, doomed characters, and a world steeped in decay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975300?t=1768549265","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/38068b0372ce7c94f78ba8c0c304e0770aa71926/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768549265","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/1d667fa34a73d9c415775abfc1b5c089b2e1b027/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768549265","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/1d667fa34a73d9c415775abfc1b5c089b2e1b027/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768549265","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Grimrail contains mature themes and imagery consistent with psychological and survival horror. Players may encounter:\r\n\r\nDepictions of violence, blood, and death (including corpses and disturbing imagery).\r\n\r\nFrightening scenes and psychological horror designed to unsettle.\r\n\r\nOccasional references to suicide and criminal acts as part of the branching storyline.\r\n\r\nUse of mild profanity and crude language during dialogue.\r\n\r\nPortrayals of alcohol and tobacco use within character interactions.\r\n\r\nAll of these elements appear in service of the game\u2019s narrative, puzzle design, and horror themes, and may vary depending on the player\u2019s choices and the paths they uncover."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GrimRail is a first-person psychological horror puzzle game about survival, choice, and uncovering hidden truths.</strong> Explore impossible spaces, confront unsettling passengers, and endure the terrors that stalk each cursed stop on this primordial train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/a0864fed5581c5126679f18ccc1f1503.avif?t=1768549265\" width=1560 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fellow travelers are trapped in the same timeless loop, each burdened with secrets. Piece together their stories across repeated cycles. Confront Clair, Malik, and Rosa with what you uncover, test fragile bonds, and decide whether to offer judgment or redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/c588f3951cf7b76d4c2a54c569218be3.poster.avif?t=1768549265\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/c588f3951cf7b76d4c2a54c569218be3.webm?t=1768549265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/c588f3951cf7b76d4c2a54c569218be3.mp4?t=1768549265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/3fcb3383931f020eb7fbe305174a2a05.poster.avif?t=1768549265\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/3fcb3383931f020eb7fbe305174a2a05.webm?t=1768549265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/3fcb3383931f020eb7fbe305174a2a05.mp4?t=1768549265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/extras/6af3b0bcee79da1019725ec72d1cce33.poster.avif?t=1768549265\" width=1170 heig